# Every text file is checked out with LF on every platform. Content files (blueprints, RON data,
# shaders, scenes) are hashed and byte-compared, so a CRLF checkout on Windows must not change them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.bin binary
# The committed token export is byte-compared by `cargo xtask tokens --check` on every platform.
game/art/tokens/world_tokens.json text eol=lf
*.res binary
